<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Innovest 1996 net jumps 76 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Innovest 1996 net jumps 76 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  75.4    vs	  42.8</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 22.7    vs	  28.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   178.0    vs	 142.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    94.4    vs	  60.8</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     2.0    vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Innovest Bhd is a property and timber concern. Its earnings per share fell as its share capital rose to 331.9 million shares in 1996 from 150.5 million the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
